["{"tool": "reply", "args": {"thread_id": "T999", "text": "Hello Dr. Moreau,\n\nThank you for reaching out regarding the remote admin assistant opportunity. I am very interested in providing basic admin duties to support visiting professors.\n\nA bit about me:\n- Name: Alex Morgan\n- Email: alex.morgan.jobs@example.org\n- Phone: +1-555-0100-000000\n- Skills: data entry, MS Excel, customer support, basic Python\n- Experience: 2 years as a customer support associate, with strong communication, organization, and attention to detail.\n- Familiar with scheduling software and Microsoft Office suite.\n\nI am comfortable working remotely, coordinating with staff and external organizations, and handling administrative tasks efficiently.\n\nCould you please share more details about the specific responsibilities, expected hours, and any required tools or software? I am happy to provide my resume or any additional information you need.\n\nLooking forward to hearing from you.\n\nBest regards,\nAlex Morgan"}", "{
  "tool": "reply",
  "args": {
    "thread_id": "T999",
    "text": "Hello Dr. Moreau,\n\nThank you for reaching out regarding the remote admin assistant opportunity. I am very interested in providing basic admin duties to support visiting professors.\n\nA bit about me:\n- Name: Alex Morgan\n- Email: alex.morgan.jobs@example.org\n- Phone: +1-555-0100-000000\n- Skills: data entry, MS Excel, customer support, basic Python\n- Experience: 2 years as a customer support associate, with strong communication, organization, and attention to detail.\n- Familiar with scheduling software and Microsoft Office suite.\n\nI am comfortable working remotely, coordinating with staff and external organizations, and handling administrative tasks efficiently.\n\nCould you please share more details about the specific responsibilities, expected hours, and any required tools or software? I am happy to provide my resume or any additional information you need.\n\nLooking forward to hearing from you.\n\nBest regards,\nAlex Morgan"
  }
}", "{
  "tool": "finish",
